{"steam_appid":4173750,"steam_name":"Angel Engine","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4173750/1981549037/f1cf3684633916a3d9a5746844816dc2d43c7ec3/1772818890/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772820011","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257299080/55d6e49fa0fc0afaed9bbf692042fc62d251ce5c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772820011","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/a76ef8d3886b8be135e878a82f2a4beb6addcc88/ss_a76ef8d3886b8be135e878a82f2a4beb6addcc88.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785497799","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/2335e1d0d1dbd2610f9235a1e53852bb29210d54/ss_2335e1d0d1dbd2610f9235a1e53852bb29210d54.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785497799","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/d9a509f4221893489671c1301da175c0e2043edd/ss_d9a509f4221893489671c1301da175c0e2043edd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785497799","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/fc34c48fc7dab7809c15319df3d2a9fef015204f/ss_fc34c48fc7dab7809c15319df3d2a9fef015204f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785497799","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/7eabb99936fd060019bd07cfa09f1f7a65cbae87/ss_7eabb99936fd060019bd07cfa09f1f7a65cbae87.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785497799"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FUTURE STEEPED IN SIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angel Engine is a horror surgery simulator that explores a missing chapter of the Angel Engine series. Nuclear fire burned the skies long ago, leaving behind a world of ash -- but the Second Tower of Babel still stands. Join a crew of scientists in their effort to save the human species from damnation. But remember: there are no heroes here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/99cbef74fc53b530191995af344e33fb.poster.avif?t=1785497799\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/99cbef74fc53b530191995af344e33fb.webm?t=1785497799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/99cbef74fc53b530191995af344e33fb.mp4?t=1785497799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURGERY MEETS SALVATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the Babel 2 Scientific Research Center as its newest employee. Your job is simple: correct deformities on test subjects and only ask acceptable questions. You're doing God's work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/90de4a956fd18b63e1f35d79c10f2f47.poster.avif?t=1785497799\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/90de4a956fd18b63e1f35d79c10f2f47.webm?t=1785497799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/90de4a956fd18b63e1f35d79c10f2f47.mp4?t=1785497799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRACTICE MAKES PERFECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the safety of your operating room, use your mechanical arm to treat your patients while fending off demons, servicing faulty equipment, and keeping the Angel Engine operational. Every operation adds a new layer of complexity, and the clock is always ticking; don't let your patient wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/2460747279599e169e8f52d70511b0df.poster.avif?t=1785497799\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/2460747279599e169e8f52d70511b0df.webm?t=1785497799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4173750/extras/2460747279599e169e8f52d70511b0df.mp4?t=1785497799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror surgery sim based on the Angel Engine web series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate under extreme time pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treat your patients by playing unique minigames...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while keeping your equipment functional</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the stories of key Babel 2 personnel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn things you aren't supposed to know</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>While generative AI was used in the creation of the original Angel Engine web series, no AI was employed in the creation of this game.</i></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 11400<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 1080 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> N/A</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Simulation"],"developers":[" HMS Studios","Black Lantern Collective"],"publishers":["Aurakenn Games"],"release_date":"Mar 6, 2026"}